% ?? \semio@table@setup stays *before* \begingroup (not moved inside,
% alongside the font-size apply, the way \semio@table@long@render orders it)
% ? moving it inside reproducibly threw a "Misplaced \omit" from deep inside
% hhline, but only under the zukunftbau `zwischenbericht` type (its
% `\SemioSetup{appendix-level=part}` chain, confirmed via bisection: neither
% \semio@table@fontsize@apply itself, nor `appendix-level=part` alone on a
% plain `semio` document, reproduce it ? only this exact combination of
% class + relocated group boundary does). Left where it was, \tabcolsep/
% \extrarowheight/etc keep resolving against the *ambient* font rather than
% a custom `text-size`, a smaller, tolerable inconsistency versus a hard
